#, no-wrap
msgid "To run on a real IBM quantum computer, you'll also need a (free) [**IBM Quantum&reg; Platform account**](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/signin?redirectTo=%2F). You can open an instance using the Open Plan to get 10 minutes of quantum processor unit (QPU) time per 28-day rolling window, which actually is quite a lot! *If you have trouble with your account, see the [Support page](/guides/support).*\n"
msgstr "Untuk menjalankan di komputer kuantum IBM sungguhan, kamu juga perlu (gratis) [**akun IBM Quantum&reg; Platform**](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/signin?redirectTo=%2F). Kamu bisa membuka instance menggunakan Open Plan untuk mendapatkan 10 menit waktu quantum processor unit (QPU) per jendela bergulir 28 hari, yang sebenarnya cukup banyak! *Jika ada masalah dengan akunmu, lihat [halaman Support](/guides/support).*\n"

